SDV aebs:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:15ms+/-1ms; offset : 0ms+/-0ms , DL: 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:15ms+/-1ms; offset : 0ms+/-0ms, DL: 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:15ms+/-1ms; offset : 0ms+/-0ms, DL: 5ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 15ms+/-1ms ; offset : 0ms+/-0ms, AD: 4ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 4ms+/-1ms)
App :
    Component Fusion :
        Signal Fusion_data
        Service S3:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            publish Fusion_data
            periodic 10ms+/-1ms ; offset : 0ms+/-0ms
            execution 4ms+/-1ms
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S2:
            subscribe to Fusion_data
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            publish to VSS signal Alarm
            triggered on Fusion_data
            execution 10ms+/-1ms

Functional Chains:
    chain1 : Camera -> S3 -> S2 -> Brake
    chain2 : Radar -> S3 -> S2 -> Alarm